cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "omicstra: a multi-agent MCP server for cross-modal embedding alignment and evidence-based routing in spatial biology"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent MCP server for spatial biology. Modality-specialized agents and
  their integration are orchestrated with LangGraph; foundation-model encoders
  are pluggable; integration strategy is a configurable experimental dimension.
  Alignments are evaluated against declared metrics, and questions are routed
  from a cohort's own recorded evidence, refusing when that evidence is absent
  rather than inheriting another cohort's result. Agents are deterministic
  components with persistent context; the server ships no model.
type: software
